14.   (New) The method of claim 12, wherein the management unit apportions all of the predetermined amount to one pack.





15.   (New) The method of claim 12, wherein the apportionment is according to quantity of air provided or rate of air provided.



16.   (New) The method of claim 12, wherein the environmental control system is on an aircraft.
